{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48857","headline":"元日观朝 · 厉玄","name":"元日观朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉座临新岁，朝盈万国人。\n火连双阙晓，仗列五门春。\n瑞雪销鸳瓦，祥光在日轮。\n天颜不敢视，称庆拜空频。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"厉玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}